Feature: Delete complication from an Access

  Background:
    Given I open the Baxter website
    And   I try to login with "login_baxter" credentials
    And   I login successful
    When  I select the patient "Ape1_1838 Ape2_1838, Nom_1838 - 1838"
    And   I open Accesses module
    Then  I check the module Accesses appear correctly


  @test @TestCase_3625
  Scenario: Delete Existing Complication
    Given I open the Baxter website
    And   I try to login with "login_baxter" credentials
    And   I login successful
    And   I Select the Group of patients "Paciente DP"
    When  I select the patient "Ape1_1838 Ape2_1838, Nom_1838 - 1838"
    And   I open Accesses module
    When  I select the Complications in main menu
    And   I click button three points complications
    And   I click button "Delete"
    And   I click button "Yes" in action modal

  @test @TestCase_3035
  Scenario: Cancel deletion
    Given I open the Baxter website
    And   I try to login with "login_baxter" credentials
    And   I login successful
    And   I Select the Group of patients "Paciente DP"
    When  I select the patient "Ape1_1838 Ape2_1838, Nom_1838 - 1838"
    And   I open Accesses module
    When  I select the Complications in main menu
    And   I click button three points complications
    And   I click button "Delete"
    And   I click button "No" in action modal
